{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic Plague 2000</strong> is a shoot 'em up that blends classic arcade gameplay with modern roguelite elements. Experience the action your way with two distinct visual modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Mode</strong> \u2013 A love letter to the old-school era, featuring filters and effects that recreate the iconic arcade aesthetics of the '80s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/8845e27be58d492a246ab8dc39d7da83.poster.avif?t=1762023899\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/8845e27be58d492a246ab8dc39d7da83.webm?t=1762023899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/8845e27be58d492a246ab8dc39d7da83.mp4?t=1762023899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong> \u2013 A crisp, filter-free presentation for those who prefer a more modern look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/bd6cc61b87f8a8ced381b5363196d67c.poster.avif?t=1762023899\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/bd6cc61b87f8a8ced381b5363196d67c.webm?t=1762023899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/bd6cc61b87f8a8ced381b5363196d67c.mp4?t=1762023899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Cosmic Battle for Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Story Mode</strong>, you take on the role of Jack, a young boy who stumbles upon a mysterious arcade machine in an abandoned game center\u2014only to be pulled into an intergalactic war. To save the galaxy, he must pilot a powerful starfighter and recover the <strong>nine magic cubes</strong> stolen by the invading Martians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/6b63b6f7706eaca871289c4825bab02c.poster.avif?t=1762023899\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/6b63b6f7706eaca871289c4825bab02c.webm?t=1762023899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/6b63b6f7706eaca871289c4825bab02c.mp4?t=1762023899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is a high-stakes challenge where you'll upgrade your ship, unlock legendary weapons, and battle relentless enemies across <strong>nine unique worlds</strong>. Can you stop the plague before it's too late?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong> \u2013 Conquer <strong>nine worlds</strong>, each with <strong>14 action-packed stages</strong> and an <strong>epic boss fight</strong> at the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/f04db49352f1219ccbc045b0493bbcae.avif?t=1762023899\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Arcade Mode</i></strong> (Extreme Survival): Test your skills in the ultimate challenge and compete to be the best player in the world on the global leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and achievement system to enhance your ship and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 types of enemies and more than 20 final bosses that will test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/cee8c6ee6ef1f933912f6d8642ee2cbd.avif?t=1762023899\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different weapon configurations with 9 weapons and 10 special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/a1a045f7bbf8938bcf0d740fa6f31928.avif?t=1762023899\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also features 5 extra challenges, which are unlocked as you progress through the game. Each challenge has 14 levels plus the final enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/cb8f6fc52fee55262a3d58382c4cf8fd.avif?t=1762023899\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dynamic sci-fi soundtrack</strong> blending <strong>16-bit retro vibes</strong> with cyberpunk and cinematic influences\u2014immersing you in an epic space adventure worthy of a classic anime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/4cf776821a452472dd51f4e53db25506.poster.avif?t=1762023899\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/4cf776821a452472dd51f4e53db25506.webm?t=1762023899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/4cf776821a452472dd51f4e53db25506.mp4?t=1762023899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Story Jack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635080/670bb68c3d743b924bc06d45fd5b4b644ae434d7.jpg"},{"name":"Survival","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635080/98dccf9ad567d8ae873215ab87b9ff498b6fd4a0.jpg"},{"name":"Plasma Gun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635080/ca382631ddc744c891a6865a43520269981ff730.jpg"},{"name":"Slide","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635080/f3ab5d2b060657b469764d6d2b701f0766b1684e.jpg"},{"name":"Super Powerful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635080/62edfc948aef828ebb92e2493538cc7c63e8675b.jpg"},{"name":"Alien Devastator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635080/1b377572076993f52177f08e9508531988776c05.jpg"},{"name":"Green Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635080/953cc4f792196dfbea38c012ad9034625b0ecc1a.jpg"},{"name":"Evolve Drones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635080/afeb635e24120d8eeef57f7c9d1eb95982b1a4d3.jpg"},{"name":"Destroy Bugs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635080/2c5c6fa7e6807a10975951b0b62f1bf1bef42da4.jpg"},{"name":"Alien Bomb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635080/f406e4bfa3593381b33e467451d06e9918e52fa1.jpg"}],"total":62},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3635080?t=1762023899","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/84a0f0c11601756aaefaa6d48536d6f43854ff23/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762023899","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/c864bb95b6b2c7373bc8ff7aa045a7d5c9be60e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762023899","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/c864bb95b6b2c7373bc8ff7aa045a7d5c9be60e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762023899","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic Plague 2000</strong> is a shoot 'em up that blends classic arcade gameplay with modern roguelite elements. Experience the action your way with two distinct visual modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Mode</strong> \u2013 A love letter to the old-school era, featuring filters and effects that recreate the iconic arcade aesthetics of the '80s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/8845e27be58d492a246ab8dc39d7da83.poster.avif?t=1762023899\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/8845e27be58d492a246ab8dc39d7da83.webm?t=1762023899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/8845e27be58d492a246ab8dc39d7da83.mp4?t=1762023899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong> \u2013 A crisp, filter-free presentation for those who prefer a more modern look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"h