ory Mode</strong> \u2013 Conquer <strong>nine worlds</strong>, each with <strong>14 action-packed stages</strong> and an <strong>epic boss fight</strong> at the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/f04db49352f1219ccbc045b0493bbcae.avif?t=1762023899\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Arcade Mode</i></strong> (Extreme Survival): Test your skills in the ultimate challenge and compete to be the best player in the world on the global leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and achievement system to enhance your ship and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 types of enemies and more than 20 final bosses that will test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/cee8c6ee6ef1f933912f6d8642ee2cbd.avif?t=1762023899\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different weapon configurations with 9 weapons and 10 special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/a1a045f7bbf8938bcf0d740fa6f31928.avif?t=1762023899\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also features 5 extra challenges, which are unlocked as you progress through the game. Each challenge has 14 levels plus the final enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/cb8f6fc52fee55262a3d58382c4cf8fd.avif?t=1762023899\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dynamic sci-fi soundtrack</strong> blending <stro